Fri Oct  2 19:56:35 UTC 2026 - Martin Hauke <mardnh@gmx.de>

- Update to version 3.0.3
  Features
  * Improve coverartarchive error handling (bcbe6fd).
  Bug fixes
  * Is_similar hamming distance (edd6aa3).
  * Aspect ratio comparison and sorting (52f43a3).
  * Possible integer underflow (eaa840b).
  * Download of smaller than expected cover (1bcc659).
  * Cover path corner cases with -p (3595244).
  * Better handling of non-ascii chars (dc2747a).
  * Escaping quotes (d008949).
  * Better handling of non-ascii filenames (c357141).
  * Embedding cover in file without tags (bafd3ff).
  * Normalization of punctuation (654076c).

