Fri Oct  2 19:05:51 UTC 2026 - Martin Hauke <mardnh@gmx.de>

- Update to version 3.0.2
  * Deezer source returning no results (259beba).
- Update to version 3.0.1
  * Increase cache lock retry timeout and silence initial log
    warnings (15e483a)
  * itunes: Probe candidate URLs in parallel (ac5b8b6).
- Update to version 3.0.0
  * Rewrite in Rust
  * Use separate transient caches for unit tests (86ec086).
  * Transparently retry if cache is locked (a36238e).
  * Improve command line help about verbosity (c6f1ab1).
  * Set default log level for third party sources to error (f5b143d)
  * Man page & shell completion generation (1937d6b)
  * Better support for various artists albums (424d256)
  * Improve debug logging when having no results (f523f45)
  * Support _album tag key (8246e85)
  * Add retries for coverartarchive source (8a61606).
- Install manpages

